    tells: [
      "a new type, enum or constant that restates what a standard, vendor sheet, man page or API document already defines, with no extdeps module citing it",
      "a value that is really an upstream fact (a port, a field name, a version, a limit, a wire shape) spelled as a literal in gunbc/ or a workflow module",
      "an extdeps module that carries our own policy, an observation this repository made, a coverage state, or a product-specific dispatch among upstreams",
      "a generic extdeps hub enumerating concrete products or versions instead of one module per independently versioned upstream"
